```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner pool --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud runner pools

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner pool [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create a runner pool
  delete  Delete a runner pool
  list    List runner pools
  rename  Rename a runner pool
  show    Show a runner pool
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
